    fix(17-67): stock-cap only when quote provider is MarketPricer
    
    Gating on PortRegistry.is_loaded broke DemoQuoteProvider tests
    (TST-SYS05-08 / WP56 q=124) because PortRegistry stays loaded
    across GUT scripts with empty market stock.
    
    Co-authored-by: wayung0217 <wayung0217@users.noreply.github.com>

diff --git a/autoload/cash_ledger.gd b/autoload/cash_ledger.gd
